rimu-ws
=======

rimu-ws is a fork of wtx, by Caio Fernandes and the wtx contributors.

  Upstream:    https://github.com/c410-f3r/wtx
  Fork point:  d22e17e0316f632e33eea62581d283ee6b6c2640 (1 November 2026)
  Fork:        https://github.com/vincentmele/rimu-ws

rimu-ws is not affiliated with or endorsed by the wtx project. "wtx" names the
upstream project only; the crates in this repository are published as rimu-ws.

